--- !u!114 &1349023599
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1349023598}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 627c1c2bfea08a54997d89f353dc3858, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  setEvents:
    events:
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1349023598}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Now you need to collect scroll before taking the quiz
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1258651923}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1907298806}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 758660449}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions:
        - player: 0
          character: {fileID: 1349023598}
          emotes: 0
          duration: 0
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 2
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1349023598}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Bayani, sa yugtong ito ng ating paglalakbay, mas nakikita natin ang
            tunay na kalagayan ng bayan. Ang mga kabanatang ito ay naglalarawan ng
            pakikibaka para sa katarungan, ang pagkamulat ni Ibarra sa kalupitan
            ng lipunan, at ang mga tahimik na sakripisyo ng mga ordinaryong Pilipino
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins: []
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1349023598}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Good day, class!
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1349023598}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Today, we are going to talk about a very interesting and important
            topic \u2014 the thematic analysis of Chapters 1 to 5 of Noli Me Tangere.
            This lesson is important because it helps us understand not only the
            story, but also the social issues and historical realities that Rizal
            wanted to expose during his time"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1258651923}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1907298806}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 758660449}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 758660449}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1349023598}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: 'Sa ika-anim antas ng ating paglalakbay sa El Filibusterismo, Dito,
            malalaman mo na ang pagbabago ay hindi agad dumarating; kailangan ng
            tiyaga, tapang, at puso. '
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1258651923}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1907298806}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 758660449}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1349023598}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: 9d5ff5378b79fe94f97cc62d7fbecec1, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Matapos ang mga trahedya, pinili ni Ibarra na lumisan upang magplano
            ng mas maayos na reporma. Ang kanyang pag-alis ay simbolo ng pansamantalang
            kabiguan ngunit hindi pagtalikod sa prinsipyo.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1349023598}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: 1a0f68754b9a45945b7ecec74991027f, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Ipinapakita rito ang mga taong patuloy na naglilingkod at nagtatanggol
            sa bayan sa kabila ng panganib. Hindi lahat ng bayani ay nakikilala;
            may mga taong tahimik ngunit may malaking ambag sa pag-usbong ng bayan.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1349023598}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: 7b1da1b90d216a043b126a320e54327d, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Nagsimula nang magbukas ang isip ni Ibarra sa ideya ng mas radikal
            na pagbabago. Sa lipunang bulok, minsan ang mapayapang reporma ay hindi
            sapat; kailangan ding planuhin ang mas organisadong laban.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1258651923}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1907298806}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 758660449}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1349023598}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: This is the end of our discussion
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1349023598}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Now you must search for 10 hidden scrolls. Each scroll contains
            trivia from Chapters 37 to 43. Collect them all, and you will unlock
            the quiz to prove what you\u2019ve learned"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1258651923}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
